OL,3,GNEWSAFatal bin lorry crash police
OL,4,Ainterview man
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a fatal crash in
OL,7,Fwhich a bin lorry hit a building have
OL,8,Finterviewed a 51-year-old man.
OL,10,FHe spoke to officers voluntarily in
OL,11,Fconnection with the collision in
OL,12,FLeominster last November in which
OL,13,FAndzie "Stan" Stanik, 62, died and two
OL,14,Fother people were seriously injured.
OL,16,FThe crash happened at the junction of
OL,17,FMill, Bridge and Broad streets, with
OL,18,Fthe injured pair later airlifted to
OL,19,Fhospital in Birmingham after crews had
OL,20,Fdifficulties rescuing them because the
OL,21,Fcrash had left the empty building
OL,22,Funstable.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
